# 第 6 课 三个选做练习的输出（原文转录，2026-11-17）

以下两段是在 WSL Ubuntu 里跑出来的，练习 ① 不花钱，② 和 ③ 的花费见末尾。
第 6 课的正式实验（95 次运行）的完整日志在同目录的 ex6.log 里。

================================================================================
练习 ① 手动和迷你服务器说话（不花钱）
================================================================================

$ printf '%s\n' \
  '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18"}}' \
  '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"}' \
  '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list"}' \
  '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_note","arguments":{"id":3}}}' > req.jsonl
$ MINI_MCP_TOOLS=12 node ~/pi/lesson6/mcp/mini_mcp.js < req.jsonl | cut -c1-300
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"protocolVersion":"2025-06-18","capabilities":{"tools":{"listChanged":false}},"serverInfo":{"name":"mini-notes","version":"1.0.0"},"instructions":"A small notebook server: 12 tools for reading and changing notes."}}
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"tools":[{"name":"list_notes","description":"List the notes in the notebook, newest first, optionally only those carrying a given tag.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"tag":{"type":"string","description":"Only list notes with this tag."},"limit":{"type
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"id: 3\ntitle: Invoice 4417\ntags: finance\nbody: Invoice 4417 from Brightwell is unpaid; the due date is the 30th. Ask accounting before paying."}],"isError":false}}

$ for n in 3 12 30; do echo -n "$n 个工具："; MINI_MCP_TOOLS=$n node ~/pi/lesson6/mcp/mini_mcp.js < req.jsonl | awk '{printf "第%d行 %d 字符；", NR, length($0)} END {print ""}'; done
3 个工具：第1行 248 字符；第2行 1122 字符；第3行 233 字符；
12 个工具：第1行 249 字符；第2行 4501 字符；第3行 233 字符；
30 个工具：第1行 249 字符；第2行 11420 字符；第3行 233 字符；

（我这一条没猜。边际成本 = (11420 − 1122) ÷ 27 = 381 字符/工具。）

